{{> menu active="about"}}

<section class="box is-3 has-text-centered">
  <h3 class="title">Weather Reporting Made Easy - Release 3</h3>
  <div class="section">
    <p>
      Welcome to Weather Reporting Made Easy Release 3! Release 3 focuses on giving users a better experience by adding detailed time and date stamps to weather reports, so you always know exactly when each reading was taken. It also lets members edit their personal details and manage their stations and reports more easily — including deleting reports or whole stations, with automatic cleanup of all related data. This update makes it smoother and more reliable to track weather conditions and keep your dashboard tidy.
    </p>
    <p>
      Features include:
      <ul>
        <li>Member sign-up and login</li>
        <li>Each member can create multiple weather stations</li>
        <li>Stations include latitude and longitude</li>
        <li>View max/min temperature, wind speed, and pressure from reports</li>
        <li>Weather report icons for quick visual reference</li>
        <li>Secure session management for persistent login</li>
      </ul>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
